            "review_title": "Review at KFC",
            "review_text": "Wandering Traveler\nBridgeboro, Georgia\n2522 contributions\n0\nFound it on the corner\nSep 2017 • Solo\nOk the restroom, bathroom, toilet, water closet, San thuong is on the actual roof. The restroom is not handicap friendly. 8 landings and 80 plus stairs. 5 floors up. I couldn't believe it. Classic KFC taste however not the same menu as America. A 3 piece chicken, slaw, fries and no bread was 146,000 dong. Business appears clean on all levels. Staff friendly with limited English skills.\nWritten September 22, 2017",
